1
00:00:00,851 --> 00:00:03,561
...but I can special-order it for you.

2
00:00:03,729 --> 00:00:05,309
(Scene:)Him.

3
00:00:05,481 --> 00:00:08,151
(Assistant:)Excuse me, sir, you don't work here.

4
00:00:09,068 --> 00:00:11,448
(Sheldon:)Yes, well, apparently,
neither does anyone else.

5
00:00:12,738 --> 00:00:14,988
- Sheldon, we have to go.
- Why?

6
00:00:15,157 --> 00:00:17,117
(Penny:)We're late for Leonard's birthday party...

7
00:00:17,284 --> 00:00:19,824
(Penny:)...and for another,
I told him to call security.

8
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:23,040
(Sheldon(to customer):)Good luck.

9
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:27,090
By the way, a 6-year-old
could hack your computer.

10
00:00:27,253 --> 00:00:28,293
(Penny:)Keep walking.

11
00:00:28,462 --> 00:00:31,462
(Sheldon:)Yeah, 1234 is not a secure password.

12
00:00:33,801 --> 00:00:36,391
(Howard:)My friend
is having allergic reaction to peanuts.

13
00:00:36,554 --> 00:00:38,934
- No, he's not.
- Yes, he is.

14
00:00:39,098 --> 00:00:41,438
(Nurse:)Look, sir, we are very busy here
and I just don't...

15
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:43,520
(Nurse:)Holy crap.

16
00:00:44,770 --> 00:00:46,980
Please help me.

17
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:49,020
Code four. I need a gurney.

18
00:00:50,234 --> 00:00:53,234
(Nurse:)- Right away, right away.
- Thank you.

19
00:00:56,741 --> 00:00:59,281
(Leonard:)Say what you will
about healthcare in this country...

20
00:00:59,452 --> 00:01:03,122
(Leonard:)...but when they're afraid of lawsuits,
they sure test everything.

